/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/016.md:6:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/016.md:7:> - 操作类：补全/completion, 平移/translate, 平铺/tiling, 填充/fill, 对称补全/symmetric_completion, 镜像/mirror, 裁剪/crop, 旋转/rotate, 拼合/compose, 分解/decompose, 重涂色/recolor, 计数/counting, 擦除/erase, 连线/connect, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 移动/move, 间隙填充/gap_filling, 周期推断/periodic_inference, 循环位移/cyclic_roll, 展开/expand, 去噪/denoise, 拉伸/stretch, 堆叠/stack, 重排/rearrange
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/016.md:8:> - 对象类：行图案/row_pattern, 画布/canvas, 瓦片/tile, 空心矩形/hollow_rect, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 对称轴/symmetry_axis, 控制标记/control_marker, 精灵体/sprite, 孔洞/hole, 前景对象/foreground_object, 基本图元/primitive_shape, 指示条/indicator_bar, 四连通物体/four_conn_object, 掩码像素/masked_pixel, 对称图案/symmetric_pattern, 角标记像素/corner_marker, 同心环/concentric_ring, 边框/frame, 周期瓦片/repeating_tile, 缺失像素/missing_pixel, 前景矩形/foreground_rectangle, 稀疏标记/sparse_marker, 边缘图例串/edge_legend_string, 孤立标记/isolated_marker, 条纹行列/stripe_line, 噪声像素/noise_pixel, 控制列/control_column, 前景列像素/column_pixels, 居中金字塔/centered_pyramid, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 分隔线/divider_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/016.md:9:> - 空间关系类：周期平移/periodic_translation, 阵列排布/array_layout, 内部区域/interior_region, 控制标记指示源侧/control_marker_indicates_source, 形状匹配/shape_matching, 对角线对齐/diagonal_alignment, 对角线上阻挡/on_diagonal_blocking, 对称轨道/symmetry_orbit, 最近归属/nearest_ownership, 颜色匹配边/color_matches_side, 标记色筛选物体/marker_filters, 颜色位置匹配/color_position_matching, 行列对齐/row_column_alignment, 基线对齐/baseline_aligned, 面积比较/area_comparison, 行偏移编码/row_offset_encode, 主色占优/dominant_color, 内部标记计数/interior_marker_count
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/016.md:10:> - 条件/判断类：周期偏移延续行/period_shift_rows, 边长决定重复数/side_len_determines_rep, 标记框内保护/marker_bbox_protect, 轴对称反射/axial_mirror_reflection, 拼图块嵌入孔洞/puzzle_pieces_fit_into_holes, 图元形状决定涂色/shape_determines_color, 条长等于物体计数/bar_equals_count, 阻挡点发射正交线/blocker_emits_orthogonal_line, 同轨道色填补损坏/orbit_mate_restores_damage, 奇偶距离决定填色/parity_distance_fill, 颜色决定目标边/color_determines_side, 忽略缺失值推断/ignore_missing_to_infer, 最少标记者选中/least_marker_selected, 双轴反射四象限/both_axes_four_quadrants, 标记位定位移量/marker_is_shift, 图例锚定对齐/legend_anchored_alignment, 主色覆盖全行列/dominant_fills_line, 标记决定拉伸终点/marker_determines_stretch_endpoint, 奇数宽度递增/odd_width_increment, 极值区域分别涂色/extreme_regions_recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/016.md:11:>
