/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/036.md:6:> - 操作类：缩放/scale, 平铺/tile, 透明叠加/transparent_overlay, 裁剪/crop, 镜像/mirror, 重涂色/recolor, 印章覆盖/stamp_overlay, 擦除/erase, 滑动/slide, 修复噪声/repair_noise, 计数/counting, 洪泛填充/flood_fill, 生成网格/generate_grid, 分离/separate, 描边/draw_inner_border, 压缩/compress, 旋转/rotate, 拼接/concatenate, 射线延伸/ray_extend, 生长/grow, 收缩/shrink
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/036.md:7:> - 对象类：分隔网格/separator_grid, 少数单元/minority_cell, 多数单元/majority_cell, 面板/panel, 分隔列/separator_column, 精灵体/sprite, 瓦片/tile, 空心矩形/hollow_rect, 内部花纹/interior_motif, 前景对象/fg_object, 轮廓边界/contour_bound, 周期瓦片/periodic_tile, 框架分区/frame_partition, 四象限/four_quadrants, 控制区域/control_region, 模板瓦片/stencil_tile, 线条对象/line_object, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 画布边界/canvas_boundary, 分隔行列/separator_row_col, 格点交叉/lattice_intersection, 噪声像素/noise_pixel, 路径片段/path_segment, 端点/endpoint, 分隔线/separator_line, 连通区域/connected_region, 分隔墙/partition_wall, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 轨迹线段/trail_segment, 中心间隙/center_gap, 微型标记/micro_marker, 行列条/row_column_bar, 重复行/dup_row, 重复列/dup_column, 锚块/anchor_block, 射线像素/ray_pixel, 角落标记/corner_marker, 墙壁障碍/wall_barrier, 装饰碎片/decoration_fragment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/036.md:8:> - 空间关系类：自相似/self_similarity, 图层优先级/layer_priority, 周期/period, 尺寸匹配/size_match, 支撑/support, 周期重复/periodic_repetition, 内外分区/in_out_partition, 行列交叉/row_col_intersection, 端点对齐/endpoint_align, 分区数决定尺寸/partition_count_determines_size, 四角布局/four_corner_layout, 可达性/reachability, 同色射线归属锚块/ray_belongs_anchor, 阵列排布/array_layout, 墙分隔区域/wall_partitions_regions, 轨迹交叉/trail_intersection, 面积最大者/largest_area, 朝向决定方向/orientation_determines_direction, 相邻相同/adjacent_identical
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/036.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：少数图案为蓝图/minority_pattern_as_blueprint, 循环序决定优先级/cyclic_order_determines_priority, 最小周期含翻转/smallest_period_flipped, 有花纹框为模板/patterned_frame_template, 有后续像素则移/shift_if_pixel_beyond, 忽略干扰项/ignore_distractors, 像素数决定尺寸/pixel_count_sets_size, 双层图案叠加/two_level_pattern, 边界连通分内外/border_in_out, 完整行列为分隔线/full_rows_cols_separators, 插入空行列间隔/insert_blank_gap, 边界连通区分结构/border_connected_distinguishes_structural, 射线像素紧缩至锚/compact_to_anchor, 四旋转组成风车/four_rot_pinwheel, 极值面积决定颜色/extreme_area_determines_color, 颜色决定运动方向/color_determines_motion, 交叉产生对角线/cross_spawns_diagonal, 最大外扩余内缩/max_grow_rest_shrink, 行覆盖列/row_overrides_column, 冲突优先级/conflict_priority, 端点匹配拼接/endpoint_match_concat, 相同行列合并/merge_identical
