/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:4:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:5:> 提取的原语（去重）：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:6:> - 操作类：连线(connect), 掩码匹配(mask_matching), 重涂色(recolor), 补全(completion), 印章覆盖(stamp_overlay), 裁剪(crop), 计数(counting), 平铺(tile), 填充(fill), 排序(sort), 堆叠(stack), 旋转(rotate), 镜像(mirror), 查表替换(lookup_replace), 异或合成(xor_compositing), 嵌入对齐(insert_and_align), 形状匹配(shape_matching), 洪泛填充(flood_fill), 擦除(erase), 推断(infer)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:7:> - 对象类：十字图案(plus_object), 格子单元(lattice_cell), 格线(grid_line), 指令区域(instruction_region), 同形精灵体(identical_sprite), 行列格点(row_column_lattice), 实心矩形(solid_rectangle), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 分隔线(separator_line), 瓦片图案(tile_pattern), 单色蒙版(monochrome_mask), 调色带(palette_strip), 前景像素(fg_pixel), 柱状条(histogram_bar), 瓦片阵列(tile_array), 分隔行列(separator_row_col), 位置孔洞(position_hole), 空心矩形(hollow_rectangle), 内部区域(interior_region), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 矩形(rectangle), 坐标轴线(coordinate_axis_line), 矩形框(rect_frame), 散落像素(scattered_pixel), 同心正方形层(concentric_ring), 图例面板(legend_panel), 编码块(encoded_block), 形状标记(shape_marker), 半区掩码(half_mask), 前景掩码(foreground_mask), 框架槽(frame_slot), 凸起条(bar_with_projections), 凹槽(pocket), 候选块(candidate_object), 结构体(structure), 前景对象(foreground_object), 格子框架(lattice_frame), 格子槽位(lattice_slot), 中性遮罩(neutral_mask)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:8:> - 空间关系类：中心对角对齐(center_diagonal_alignment), 格子分割(lattice_partition), 逐列对应(column_correspondence), 调色板顺序(palette_order), 阵列坐标编码(array_coord_encoding), 包含(containment), 包围(enclosure), 距离排序(distance_ordering), 颜色对应边(color_to_side), 嵌套层序(nesting_order), 颜色与形状对应(color_shape_match), 对齐(alignment), 列对齐(column_alignment), 旋转平移嵌入(rotate_translate_to_fit), 最近邻选择(nearest_neighbor_selection), 跨框架对应(cross_frame_match), 邻接传色(adjacency_transfer), 格点对齐(lattice_alignment), 网格分区(grid_partition)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:9:> - 条件/判断类：无障碍通路(unobstructed_path), 块解码为掩码(decode_block_to_mask), 像素匹配掩码位置(pixels_match_mask_positions), 笛卡尔积缺位填充(cartesian_product_gap_fill), 标记最多者选取(rectangle_with_most_markers_selected), 已填瓦片填空槽(filled_tile_to_empty_slots), 调色带指定列色(palette_assigns_color), 计数渲染柱状图(counts_as_histogram), 孔洞位置等于坐标(hole_equals_coordinate), 最大边框内部提取(largest_frame_interior_extract), 面积决定填充色(area_determines_fill_color), 轴色决定旋转(axis_color_determines_rotation), 散落连接同色框边(scatter_connect_side), 色沿层序循环移(colors_cycle_by_nesting), 旋转镜像等价匹配(rotation_reflection_match), 恰一为前景(exactly_one_foreground), 凸起匹配标记列(projections_match_columns), 完全覆盖(full_coverage), 无重叠(no_overlap), 欧氏距离最小(minimum_euclidean_distance), 槽位位置决定颜色(slot_position_color), 标记接触即赋色(marker_touch_color)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:10:>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/14/044.md:11:> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。
